		}
		{
			title: "Did he say Cheese Sandwich?"
			x: 1.25d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&7Starting a group should get you a Mailbox and a Bulletin Board. Put up both, and you'll get an Envelope with a Contract, and a Sealed Parcel with some items in the mail. Mail arrives / sends every in-game dawn, and may contain Contracts, rewards, or more."
				""
				"&7When you receive a Contract you want to fill, hold it and Right Click it onto the Bulletin Board to track it."
				""
				"&7Many of your early contracts will be to help the User run Wiki for the FOP Game Server. For that, you'll need the Camera I sent you. (If you need a new one, you'll have to unlock the DLC)"
				""
				"&7You need to take a picture of the requested Creature or Biome, which will require 1 Paper per photo. You then grab an Envelope (that parcel contained a bunch of them, or you can craft them), Right Click to open it, and place the Photo (or other singular item) into it. Then you can put it into the Outgoing section of your Mailbox."
			]
			dependencies: ["288B4CFEEC379A41"]
			id: "047154F810F692A4"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "498E1E4EF802775A"
					type: "item"
					item: {
						id: "camera:image"
						Count: 1b
						tag: {
							image: { }
						}
					}
				}
				{
					id: "15F09110C7E1AF57"
					type: "item"
