			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Shipping Packages"
			x: 1.25d
			y: 1.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&7What's that The Camera Man sent you... a Coal Generator? Oh, excellent, that should help things along then!"
				""
				"&7Envelopes are all well and good for shipping photos, but you should start getting requests for stacks of items pretty soon! For that, you'll need a bigger shipping container..."
				""
				"&7The Parcel is useful as it holds up to 16 of a stacking item (so not 16 Diamond Hoes for example!). It can be shipped out via the Mailbox."
				""
				"&7For Bigger stacks, or multiple items, you'll need a Cardboard Box. This comes in mulitple tiers, each one holding more items. But this box doesn't fit in the Mailbox..."
				""
				"&7Make yourself a Drone Pad. A Drone will automatically land on it, waiting to ship out an order. You can toss the Cardboard Box into this to send it out. It needs power, so place that Coal Generator next to the Drone Pad and feed it Coal."
			]
			dependencies: ["047154F810F692A4"]
			id: "62D5F301E541E3FA"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "1F4DFCC1B6C81CCE"
					type: "item"
					item: "delivery:parcel"
				}
				{
					id: "70E0D78050970081"
					type: "item"
					item: "delivery:cardboard_box_tier_1"
				}
				{
					id: "41F4ED74B4C0F316"
					type: "item"
					item: "delivery:drone_pad"
				}
			]
			rewards: [{
				id: "34B2D0CE057191CD"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 2640422954496342337L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "To Create a Factory"
			x: -4.75d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&7These orders, however, are going to need to be packed properly for shipping... and set up with the Aubudon Worm of course."
				""
				"&7For that, you're going to want to buy the Create DLC and get a Create factory up and running. You'll need a Mechanical Belt system that passes under a series of Deployers and Spouts, and occasionally a Mechanical Saw and a Mechanical Press. "
				""
				"&7You can get away with probably a looping belt of 5 Deployers, 2 Spouts, 1 Saw, and 1 Press. Looping is key, so either have the belts go in a circle, or some method of transporting the partially filled Crates to the beginning again. Maybe Drones or pipes or something..."
				""
				"&7Oh, the Crates? Those are easy to make. Planks and a Ferret Coin, bam, a whole stack. Simple huh?"
			]
			dependencies: ["5B0E3E42F5528623"]
			id: "7E52F0E303AF20FB"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "4CD26D3769205F2B"
					type: "item"
					item: "create:deployer"
				}
